      {
        "id": "model-gd-cycle",
        "moduleId": "optimization-setup",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：优化的迭代循环",
        "markdown": "训练目标通常写成参数向量 $\\mathbf{x}$ 的函数 $f(\\mathbf{x})$，希望找到使 $f$ 尽量小的参数。只有少数问题存在可直接求解的闭式解，一般情形只能从一个初始点出发，重复“计算当前梯度—沿下降方向移动一步—检查停止条件”的循环。梯度下降把这个循环固定为最简单的形式，因此适合作为分析优化行为的起点。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-gd-role"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-taylor-one-dim",
        "moduleId": "one-dim-derivation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "一维梯度下降的泰勒展开依据",
        "markdown": "考虑连续可微的实值函数 $f:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}$。由一阶泰勒展开，\n$$f(x+\\epsilon) = f(x) + \\epsilon f'(x) + \\mathcal{O}(\\epsilon^2).$$\n取固定步长 $\\eta>0$，令 $\\epsilon=-\\eta f'(x)$，即把移动方向取为负梯度方向，代入上式得到\n$$f(x-\\eta f'(x)) = f(x) - \\eta f'^2(x) + \\mathcal{O}(\\eta^2 f'^2(x)).$$\n只要 $f'(x)\\neq 0$，就有 $-\\eta f'^2(x)<0$；并且总可以把 $\\eta$ 取得足够小，使高阶项变得无关紧要。于是\n$$f(x-\\eta f'(x)) \\lesssim f(x).$$",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-567d03760c49273830ecff85",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000086"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "优化算法",
                "梯度下降"
              ],
              "lineStart": 18494,
              "lineEnd": 18981,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0005/images/deaf0e59e0372a4687fffe4a88fadd7e154a3b0e2713678a677b60eb366cdba3.jpg",
                "parts/part-0005/images/c9a5717479f09c562f7b81accabf9218e16a579305dbf2bdec4773d447fcaaa0.jpg",
                "parts/part-0005/images/221f439b2d83b02d96e9281cfd5d5203731c47a92a97d32575185bb49a94b122.jpg",
                "parts/part-0005/images/58bb24ad40adcf5be9b8c7009f47b434933948678cac9d31a07ec9dcad890c99.jpg",
                "parts/part-0005/images/df68524dafefb6672e168e3f7d509bdcd64cd29ebca21e55654a61ecd819f8b7.jpg",
                "parts/part-0005/images/fa24507693db8f6b32aa66e33167714f9fc3a96091192bafd953cc976ace0598.jpg",
                "parts/part-0005/images/120c93695791e69f660282013a6b1a5a9fd0da335062d92285721b71db7d00ef.jpg",
                "parts/part-0005/images/7d81660fd1d3cd9e213a7eae8bb2cbe96d370c415a4e07279e638f5c1e139915.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "6473a53d1d80cee7e7adb5ffaf94c50af7c0fca258cf0f0c9d7f0a9923fcdb0c"
            }
