      {
        "id": "tb-multivariate",
        "moduleId": "multivariate-and-2d",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "多元梯度与更新式",
        "markdown": "多元情形下，参数是向量 $\\mathbf{x}=[x_1,x_2,\\ldots,x_d]^\\top$，目标函数 $f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}$ 把向量映射为标量，梯度是由 $d$ 个偏导数组成的向量：\n$$\\nabla f(\\mathbf{x}) = \\left[\\frac{\\partial f(\\mathbf{x})}{\\partial x_1},\\frac{\\partial f(\\mathbf{x})}{\\partial x_2},\\ldots,\\frac{\\partial f(\\mathbf{x})}{\\partial x_d}\\right]^\\top.$$\n相应的泰勒近似为\n$$f(\\mathbf{x}+\\boldsymbol{\\epsilon}) = f(\\mathbf{x}) + \\boldsymbol{\\epsilon}^\\top\\nabla f(\\mathbf{x}) + \\mathcal{O}(\\|\\boldsymbol{\\epsilon}\\|^2).$$\n在 $\\boldsymbol{\\epsilon}$ 的二阶项以内，最陡下降方向由负梯度 $-\\nabla f(\\mathbf{x})$ 给出。取学习率 $\\eta>0$，得到多元梯度下降的更新式\n$$\\mathbf{x} \\leftarrow \\mathbf{x} - \\eta\\nabla f(\\mathbf{x}).$$",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
