      {
        "id": "tb-newton",
        "moduleId": "adaptive-methods",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "牛顿法：用 Hessian 确定步长",
        "markdown": "把泰勒展开保留到二阶：\n$$f(\\mathbf{x}+\\boldsymbol{\\epsilon}) = f(\\mathbf{x}) + \\boldsymbol{\\epsilon}^\\top\\nabla f(\\mathbf{x}) + \\frac{1}{2}\\boldsymbol{\\epsilon}^\\top\\nabla^2 f(\\mathbf{x})\\boldsymbol{\\epsilon} + \\mathcal{O}(\\|\\boldsymbol{\\epsilon}\\|^3).$$\n记 Hessian 为 $\\mathbf{H}=\\nabla^2 f(\\mathbf{x})$，它是 $d\\times d$ 矩阵。最小值满足 $\\nabla f=0$，对展开式关于 $\\boldsymbol{\\epsilon}$ 求导并忽略高阶项，得到 $\\nabla f(\\mathbf{x})+\\mathbf{H}\\boldsymbol{\\epsilon}=0$，即\n$$\\boldsymbol{\\epsilon} = -\\mathbf{H}^{-1}\\nabla f(\\mathbf{x}),$$\n这就是牛顿法的更新方向。对 $f(x)=\\frac{1}{2}x^2$，有 $\\nabla f(x)=x$、$H=1$，于是 $\\epsilon=-x$，一步即可精确收敛；对凸的双曲余弦函数，几次迭代后也到达 $x=0$ 处的全局最小值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
